{"name":"Snub","hex":"#a5adbd","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"snub","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Conspicuously short.","Flat and broad, with the end slightly turned up."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deliberate affront or slight.","A sudden checking of a cable or rope."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/snub"}],"entries":[{"title":"Snub","blocks":[{"text":"A snub, cut, or slight is a refusal to recognise an acquaintance by ignoring them, avoiding them or pretending not to know them. For example, a failure to greet someone may be considered a snub."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2f/Who%27s_your_fat_friend.png/330px-Who%27s_your_fat_friend.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snub","wikidata":"Q7548771"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"snub":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/En-us-snub.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/En-us-snub.ogg/En-us-snub.ogg.mp3"}]}}}